span=\"1\"><p>Connector</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1</p></td><td><p>Engine temperature sender unit</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p><a href=\"#/3024255\">K36</a></p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002641.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the thermostat (1b).</p><p>2. Remove the seal.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2002642.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[2,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Fit the thermostat, complete with gasket,\nand fix it tightening the bolts to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2001243.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>Bolt</p></td><td><p>THERMOSTAT</p></td><td><p>M8</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>(Cylinder head side) 2.3 ÷ 2.8</p></td></tr></table></div><p>Connect the electrical connection to the\nengine coolant temperature sensor.</p>"]]